---
import { PenTool, Target, Layers } from 'lucide-react';
---
<section class="relative overflow-hidden border-b border-zinc-900 bg-zinc-950 py-24 md:py-32">
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute left-1/2 top-0 -z-10 h-[400px] w-[800px] -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-zinc-800/30 blur-[100px]" />

  <div class="relative z-10 mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="mx-auto mb-16 max-w-3xl text-center md:mb-24">
      <h2 class="mb-6 text-4xl font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-white md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl">
        Manufacturing shouldn't feel complicated.
      </h2>
      <p class="text-lg font-medium text-zinc-400 md:text-xl">
        We've built our entire process around predictability. When you send us a complex part, you should know exactly when it will arrive.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 md:grid-cols-3 md:gap-8">
      <div class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] border border-zinc-800/50 bg-zinc-900/50 p-10 backdrop-blur-md transition-all duration-500 hover:bg-zinc-900 md:rounded-[2.5rem] md:p-12">
        <div class="absolute -right-16 -top-16 h-40 w-40 rounded-full bg-white/5 blur-3xl transition-colors group-hover:bg-white/10" />
        <div class="relative z-10 mb-8 flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl border border-zinc-700 bg-zinc-800 text-white md:mb-10 md:h-16 md:w-16 md:rounded-3xl">
          <PenTool size={28} strokeWidth={1.5} aria-hidden="true" />
        </div>
        <h3 class="relative z-10 mb-4 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white md:text-3xl">
          Engineering Support
        </h3>
        <p class="relative z-10 text-base leading-relaxed text-zinc-400 md:text-lg">
          Need help designing your part? We'll optimize it for manufacturing, identifying cost drivers and potential tolerance stacking issues before chips fly.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] border border-white bg-zinc-100 p-10 text-zinc-950 shadow-2xl md:-translate-y-4 md:rounded-[2.5rem] md:p-12">
        <div class="absolute -right-16 -top-16 h-48 w-48 rounded-full bg-zinc-300/50 blur-3xl" />
        <div class="relative z-10 mb-8 flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl border border-zinc-200 bg-white text-zinc-950 shadow-sm md:mb-10 md:h-16 md:w-16 md:rounded-3xl">
          <Target size={28} strokeWidth={1.5} aria-hidden="true" />
        </div>
        <h3 class="relative z-10 mb-4 text-2xl font-bold uppercase tracking-tight md:text-3xl">
          Precision Manufacturing
        </h3>
        <p class="relative z-10 text-base font-medium leading-relaxed text-zinc-600 md:text-lg">
          From first-article prototype to full-scale production. We guarantee repeatability across every run with tightly controlled processes and advanced fixturing.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] border border-zinc-800/50 bg-zinc-900/50 p-10 backdrop-blur-md transition-all duration-500 hover:bg-zinc-900 md:rounded-[2.5rem] md:p-12">
        <div class="absolute -right-16 -top-16 h-40 w-40 rounded-full bg-white/5 blur-3xl transition-colors group-hover:bg-white/10" />
        <div class="relative z-10 mb-8 flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl border border-zinc-700 bg-zinc-800 text-white md:mb-10 md:h-16 md:w-16 md:rounded-3xl">
          <Layers size={28} strokeWidth={1.5} aria-hidden="true" />
        </div>
        <h3 class="relative z-10 mb-4 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white md:text-3xl">
          Project Management
        </h3>
        <p class="relative z-10 text-base leading-relaxed text-zinc-400 md:text-lg">
          One point of contact. Transparent communication. Reliable delivery. We manage the supply chain, finishing, and logistics so you don't have to.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
